PiFIDO runtime data lives in /data/pifido on the second ext4 partition.
Credential updates are serialized, fsync'd, and atomically replaced before
the CTAP success response is sent.

Physical user presence is enabled through the two-wire GPIO26-to-GND contact.
The contact must be released before each request and is debounced and timed
out. Automatic user presence is disabled in the production image.
